{
 "_about": "Credits that a licence requires, bound to the thing they credit. The editor cannot open this file, and the check in .github/workflows/editor-content-only.yml refuses any editor change to it. photos: each photograph from another source, keyed by its file (without the -380.webp ending); wherever that photograph is shown, its photographer and licence are shown beneath it, and it is listed on the credits page. groups: the credits page entries a licence requires. Each appears on the credits page whenever the thing it credits is on the website, where the editor places it or, if the editor has removed it, at the end. Entries are HTML. See docs/CONTRIBUTING.md, 'Credits a licence requires'.",
