  "elevation": {
   "heading": "Elevation data",
   "credits": "the maps of the catchment and the action area, and the interactive map, which are drawn from it",
   "entries": [
    "Copernicus DEM GLO-30. © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved. The catchment boundary, area, elevation range and longest flow path are derived from it. The stop and photograph elevations combine it with the group's own GPS track of the trail, and are given to the nearest 5 metres."
   ],
