   "credits": "the species list",
   "entries": [
    "Made using <a href=\"https://plantnet.org/\" rel=\"noopener\">Pl@ntNet</a>. Determinations are as accepted by the contributor and have not been independently verified.",
    "Species descriptions are summarised in our own words from the <a href=\"https://plantatlas2020.org/\" rel=\"noopener\">BSBI Plant Atlas 2020</a>, the Botanical Society of Britain and Ireland’s survey of the flora of Britain and Ireland. The account for each species is linked beneath its description. No text is reproduced.",
    "Determination data: Pl@ntNet, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY</a>. Observations recorded by Cáirde Corrin on the Northern Europe flora."
