   ]
  },
  "species-photos": {
   "heading": "Species reference photographs",
   "credits": "the species reference photographs",
   "entries": [
    "Twelve photographs from <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, cropped to 3:2 and resized for this site, and served from this site rather than hotlinked. Each shows the species, not the individual plant that was recorded. Autumn hawkbit has no photograph because it is recorded to family only, so there is no binomial to check a photograph against."
   ]
  },
